For a candidate deployer wallet, look up:
  - first native-coin inflow (from, amount, time, tx)
  - most recent significant gas funding within 7d before deploy

Kinds: direct | one_hop | shared_funder | pattern
Hop/time decay per §5.3. Public funders (known_public_funders.json) excluded.
No tx/amount/time → never hard evidence.

Network: free Blockscout txlist for ethereum + ink; Etherscan API V2
(env ETHERSCAN_API_KEY) for hyperevm (free tier) and optionally base/bsc/
robinhood when the key's plan covers them (Lite+). Missing key or paid-only
chain → funding_gaps. Keys are never logged or written into funding_link objects.
"""
